QUERY NAME: qrySurvCWContrib
---------------------------------------------
TYPE: SELECT

SQL:
SELECT DISTINCTROW ProjectMonthFinal.Project, ProjectMonthFinal.CumCWDebit, ProjectMonthFinal.MonthNo
FROM ProjectMonthFinal
WHERE (((ProjectMonthFinal.CumCWDebit)<>0) AND ((ProjectMonthFinal.MonthNo)=[Forms]![frmPactReportMenu]![PeriodPick]));

